Cell["\<\
By default the \[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]gaNonCommutativeMonomialOrder \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\[Rule]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] InvDeg[Lex]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is used. In order to fully distinguish between all \
possible orderings an algebra of vector space dimension 4 or larger is \
necessary:\
